From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:34:57 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 402/443] [ae-patch] Keep a harness compaction's spinner
 through turn ends

A claude-native harness compaction can outlive the turn that started it, but the page deleted its spinner (and the defrag strip hid) when that turn settled. The server now marks harness-reported in_progress events background=true, and the page keeps background spinners through turn settles until completed, failed, or an explicit Stop.
